# Optional LOCAL refresh every 15 minutes. This is not how GitHub Pages is updated.
# GitHub Actions schedule can drift or pause; the live dashboard shows STALE if
# generated_at is older than 2 hours. Install with: crontab crontab.example
# Adjust the path. Uses python3 from PATH. No API keys required.
*/15 * * * * cd /path/to/borealis-solana && python3 generate.py >> /tmp/borealis.log 2>&1
